      "writtenOn": "2024-11-13T09:54:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When we disconnect, the connection is removed from le_acl_connections_ in le_impl.h . Is there a value in keeping this object in \"disconnecting\" state ? Wouldn\u0027t it be simpler to just delete the connection when we are in \"disconnecting\" ?",
